[node name="InspectableInteraction" parent="." unique_id=190712381 instance=ExtResource("2_dyc2l")]
content = "We successfully transferred Subject-06 to one of the containment cells,
It's strange how a mother can report her own daughter.

Subject-06 spent some time in a psychiatric hospital,
and all her information was there: address, name, family records, everything,
Finding her was easier than expected.

She will be an excellent subject for further observation and experimentation.

---

We still have no sign of the others,
Except for Subject-01.

He remains active somewhere in the city,
According to the reports, he was the one who started all of this, Patient Zero.

Containment has failed,
The city is gone.

And what remains of it?
Only memories of what was once a city.
"
collect_sound_effect = ExtResource("3_orp1d")
item_data = SubResource("Resource_o5mgu")
